    "description": "Hand-Carved Wooden Figurine\nMan Smoking Pipe Folk Art Sculpture\nCarved Solid Wood, 28 Inches\nThis hand-carved wooden folk art sculpture depicts a standing bearded man wearing a wide-brimmed hat and rustic attire, smoking a pipe and carrying a curved horn. Rendered from solid wood, the piece features expressive facial carving, rhythmic gouge work, and contrasting dark-stained accents that highlight the organic grain and textures of the timber. Large-scale figurative carvings of this style reflect traditional vernacular woodworking traditions and make compelling additions to rustic, global, or folk art collections.\nHand-carved solid timber construction with chiseled gouge details\nDepicts a standing elder figure with pipe, brimmed hat, and shoulder strap\nNatural warm wood tone accented with black-stained detailing\nIntegrated round pedestal base carved from the same solid block\nCondition:\nStructurally intact and stable on base. Natural age checking and drying cracks are visible on the hat brim and base underside, typical of solid wood carvings. Minor surface finish wear and light dust in recesses. No detached pieces or structural breaks.\nWarehouse Location: Cleveland\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
